From 0c6d155acbe8dc4af25b216e281a665de5541da4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 22:22:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): sidebar no longer paints a session green while
 its /goal is still active [daveey]

Between goal turns (and while the judge parks it on a wait timer) no turn
is live, so the row read as done although the goal loop resumes it unasked.
Session-list endpoints now stamp goal_active (state_meta goal:<id> with
status=active, over the lineage, across profiles) and the dot state claims
it as background, same as kanban_active.
